  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Private Agriculture Sector Support - Bridging Grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of this project is to promote the concept of IGG for environmental and social sustainability in the agricultural sector. 

The objective is to accelerate the level of productive investments among agribusiness entrepreneurs that promotes IGG. 

PASS will achieve this goal through three main work streams: 
1.	The IGG concept will be mainstreamed into all operations and PASS will continue to focus on improving social and environmental performance.
2.	PASS will build its capacity to influence change among clients, partner banks and other key stakeholders.  
3.	PASS products and services  will be compliant with social and environmental legislation and PASS aims, through its products and services, to go beyond &quot;do no harm&quot; by identifying and integrating relevant IGG opportunities.</narrative>
  </description>
